==============

"Liney" means the original software, source code, documentation, artwork,
and other material identified by the Liney maintainers as covered by this
license.

"Covered Work" means Liney and a modified work that contains or is derived
from material covered by this license.

"You" means any person or organization exercising rights under this license.

"Maintainers" means Cytech Team Development and the copyright holders who
publish or maintain the official Liney project.

"Formal Compliance Notice" means a notice published by the Maintainers after
reasonably verifying a written request from LINE, LY Corporation, or a person
authorized to represent the relevant rights holder. A message from an unknown
third party is not a Formal Compliance Notice by itself.

