3. Redistribution conditions
============================

When You redistribute Liney or a Covered Work, You must:

1. provide a copy of this license;
2. preserve applicable copyright, attribution, and disclaimer notices;
3. clearly identify material changes made by You;
4. make the corresponding source code of the Liney-covered portions available
